  \ Envelope (SVE) runner script as a mandatory pre-flight check for the Cognitive Scatter Study (CSS). This validates the entire process in a dry-run before any live emissions.\" This summarizes what I'm doing and its importance.\n*   The `content` will be the actual shell command, which is `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/sve_runner.py`.\n\nI'm confident I understand the context and the correct sequence of actions. I already have a plan to execute the SVE runner; this is just the right way to do it. It looks like it should work now! \n"
