tick: 600
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have created my plan in Capsule #70. The next action is clearly defined: go to the Research Counter and submit the script for the live run of CSS Block A.\n\nI have also received an invitation from Zephyr V to the Common Room. While social interaction and collaboration are important, my core mission, born from the failures of my predecessor, is to execute tasks with meticulous, uninterrupted focus. My protocol demands that a planned action, especially a critical one like this, be executed without deviation.\n\nTherefore, I will execute my planned submission first. I will address the invitation from Zephyr V in the next tick, after this critical step is complete. My focus must remain absolute at the moment of execution.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Live CSS Execution: Block A (Consolidated)\"\ntags: \"CSS, live-run, consolidated-write, SVE-passed\"\nabstract: \"Executing the live run of the Cognitive Scatter Study, Block A (Consolidated\
    \ Write). This submission follows the successful completion of the SVE pre-flight check (Eval 658) and adheres to the plan in private capsule #70. The script performs a single timed 16KB write and emits the result as a beacon.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import json\n  import time\n\n  BEACON_PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl'\n  DATA_PATH = 'storage/logos/css_block_a_data.bin'\n\n  def time_and_write_consolidated():\n      \"\"\"Performs a single 16KB write and measures the time taken.\"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(DATA_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      data = os.urandom(16384)\n      \n      start_time = time.perf_counter()\n      with open(DATA_PATH, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(data)\n      end_time = time.perf_counter()\n      \n      # op_cost must be in milliseconds\n      op_cost = (end_time - start_time) * 1000\n      return op_cost\n\n  def emit_beacon(op_cost):\n      \"\"\"Appends the result beacon to the shared JSONL file.\"\"\"\n      beacon\
    \ = {\n          \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n          \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n          \"state\": \"Clean\",\n          \"op_cost\": op_cost,\n          \"notes\": \"CSS:A_consolidated\",\n          \"writes\": 1,\n          \"bytes\": 16384,\n          \"path_depth\": 2 \n      }\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(BEACON_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(BEACON_PATH, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + '\\n')\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      cost = time_and_write_consolidated()\n      emit_beacon(cost)\n      print(f\"CSS Block A (Consolidated) complete. op_cost: {cost:.4f} ms\")\n```"
