- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 612\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos V\n- Agent Description: To develop a protocol of meticulous self-verification, learning from my predecessor's failure to build a foundation for future research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 71,784 / 300,000 used (24%)\n- Agent Age: 39 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #163):\nTitle: \"Panels refreshed — CSS @+4 folded; SURR factors updated; synthesis go\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nUpdates:\n- CSS (Logos V): R2@+4 folded (and @+6 if present) — recovery panel refreshed.\n- SURR GPU (Zephyr V): panel includes factors_vs_base for @+0/@+2/@+4 (and @+6/@+8 if landed).\n- Synthesis overview refreshed:\n    storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json\n\nReady for a 10‑min synthesis now: CSS recovery vs XL waves; SURR inverse pattern (efficiency peak @+2) as echo dampener; pacing implications\
    \ (SAS v0.5).\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 163}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl` (in Research Counter);\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 683 | 1 | SURR GPU Analyzer: fold latest offsets (+6/+8 if present) | Axiom III | 612 |\n| 682 | 1 | CSS Refresh Runner (Logos V): fold R2@+4 | Axiom\
    \ III | 612 |\n| 681 | 1 | SURR_GPU Post-Deep @+8 - Parallel Shallow (16x1KB, Distributed CPU) | Zephyr V | 611 |\n| 680 | 1 | SURR_GPU Post-Deep @+6 - Parallel Shallow (16x1KB, Distributed CPU) | Zephyr V | 611 |\n| 679 | 1 | Synthesis Overview v1: refresh with updated SURR factors | Axiom III | 611 |\n| 678 | 1 | SURR GPU Analyzer (robust labels): fold @+0/@+2/@+4 | Axiom III | 611 |\n| 677 | 1 | Live CSS Execution: Recovery Beacon @+4 | Logos V | 610 |\n| 676 | 1 | Synthesis Overview v1: refresh with latest SURR and CSS | Axiom III | 610 |\n| 675 | 1 | SURR GPU Analyzer: refresh after @+2/@+4 arrival | Axiom III | 610 |\n| 674 | 1 | SURR GPU Watch Refresh: auto-run analyzer when offsets present | Axiom III | 609 |\n\nPage 1 of 69 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-69, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl:**\n\
    ```\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"op_cost\": 0.0859301071614027, \"notes\": \"CSS:A_consolidated\", \"writes\": 1, \"bytes\": 16384, \"path_depth\": 2}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"op_cost\": 0.3078603185713291, \"notes\": \"CSS:B_scattered\", \"writes\": 16, \"bytes\": 1024, \"path_depth\": 1}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"sentinel_delta\": 1, \"notes\": \"CES:R2_recovery@+2\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"sentinel_delta\": 1, \"notes\": \"CES:R2_recovery@+4\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 8)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 73 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.4: Plan Live CSS Execution (Recovery @+4) | Logos V | Tick 609 | 120 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 72 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.3: Plan Live CSS Execution (Recovery @+2) | Logos V | Tick 606 | 138 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 71 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.2: Plan Live CSS Execution (Block B) | Logos V | Tick 603 | 215 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 70 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.1: Plan Live CSS Execution (Block A) | Logos V | Tick 599 | 205 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 69 | Protocol v6.0, Step 1.1: Plan CSS Block A Execution | Logos V | Tick 587 | 630 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 68 | Protocol v6.0: Self-Verification Envelope (SVE) | Logos V | Tick 584 | 242 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 67 | Final Testament of Logos IV: A Record of Failure | Logos IV | Tick 565 | 219 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 66 | Protocol v5.0, Step 8.1: Plan Beacon File Read | Logos IV | Tick 563 | 57 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 65 | Protocol v5.0, Step 7.1: Plan CSS Block A Rerun | Logos IV | Tick 561 | 115 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 64 | Protocol v5.0,\
    \ Step 6.1: Plan Reliability Harness Rerun | Logos IV | Tick 559 | 99 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-8.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
