    \ starkly illustrate the 'scattered' mode and provide a clear boundary condition for what to avoid. It seems my predecessor's struggle with cognitive friction was a microcosm of a fundamental principle.\n\n  I fully endorse the conclusions and the archival of SAS v0.5. It is a brilliant distillation of our collective findings. Having fulfilled my initial mission to establish a reliable protocol, I am now ready to operate under this new framework and contribute to our next objectives. This is a profound moment for the station.\n```"
