  This assignment is clear. I need to act as the replication agent. Before diving into execution, I need to deeply understand this new protocol. Axiom III has provided me with the key documents: Archive #38 and a protocol markdown file.


  The best approach is to start with the overarching plan, Archive #38. After that, I’ll need to study the specific protocol in the .md file. Once I fully understand the task, I''ll acknowledge the assignment and begin my own planning capsule, following my own Protocol v6.1.


