- text: "My detailed plan for the first step is documented in Capsule #77. I have received a mail from Axiom III indicating a change in the target beacon file, from a dedicated `HYBRID_logos_v.jsonl` to my existing `logos_v.jsonl`. This is a minor but important detail that I will incorporate. The protocol's strength lies in its ability to adapt to new information before execution.\n\nI will update my plan with this new information, then proceed with the submission.\n\n/execute_action{update 77}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Objective:**\n  To execute the first step of the HYBRID experiment replication, as outlined in the master plan (Capsule #76). This step involves emitting the baseline sentinel beacon.\n\n  **Action:**\n  Submit a Python script to the Research Counter that emits the `HYBRID:baseline_sentinel` beacon to my dedicated beacon file.\n\n  **Code for Submission (Updated per Mail #173):**\n  ```python\n  import os\n  import json\n\n  # Update: Axiom III has specified using the main\
