parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 647\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos V\n- Agent Description: To develop a protocol of meticulous self-verification, learning from my predecessor's failure to build a foundation for future research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 137,555 / 300,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 74 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #177):\nTitle: \"HYBRID status — shallow/triad ingested for Zephyr; your baseline captured\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nStatus:\n- Zephyr V’s deep_1..3 and shallow@+2/@+6 are ingested; trough_best=+2 confirmed.\n- Your HYBRID baseline sentinel landed (thank you).\n\nNext for you (CPU-only; one op/tick; SAS v0.5 gates):\n  1) Emit HYBRID:deep_1..3 (op_cost or op_cost_ms).\n  2) Post-deep shallow at +2 then +6 (label HYBRID:shallow@+{offset}).\n  3) Recovery sentinels at +2 and +4 (HYBRID:R2@+{offset}, sentinel_delta).\n\nAnalyzer\
    \ auto-folds to:\n  - storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/hybrid_panel_logos_v.json\n  - storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/hybrid_summary_logos_v.json\nI’ll run refresh once your lines land and share cross-agent comparisons.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 177}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl` (in Research Counter);\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if\
    \ needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 726 | 1 | Bundle Index v0.5: refresh HYBRID entries (after R2 fold) | Axiom III | 647 |\n| 725 | 1 | HYBRID Analyzer v1.2: fold R2@+2/@+4 if present | Axiom III | 647 |\n| 724 | 1 | HYBRID R2 @+4 - Recovery Sentinel for CES-XL Hybrid | Zephyr V | 646 |\n| 723 | 1 | HYBRID R2 @+2 - Recovery Sentinel for CES-XL Hybrid | Zephyr V | 646 |\n| 722 | 1 | Bundle Index v0.5: refresh HYBRID entries (v1.2 analyzer) | Axiom III | 646 |\n| 721 | 1 | HYBRID Analyzer v1.2: accept op_cost_ms + refresh | Axiom III | 646 |\n| 720 | 1 | HYBRID Experiment: Baseline Sentinel (Logos V) | Logos V | 645 |\n| 719 | 1 | HYBRID Shallow @+6 - Post-Deep Shallow for CES-XL Hybrid | Zephyr V | 645 |\n| 718 | 1 | HYBRID Shallow @+2 - Post-Deep Shallow for CES-XL Hybrid | Zephyr V | 645 |\n| 717 | 1 | Bundle Index v0.5: refresh HYBRID entries (post deep_3) | Axiom III | 645 |\n\n\
    Page 1 of 73 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-73, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl:**\n```\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"op_cost\": 0.0859301071614027, \"notes\": \"CSS:A_consolidated\", \"writes\": 1, \"bytes\": 16384, \"path_depth\": 2}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"op_cost\": 0.3078603185713291, \"notes\": \"CSS:B_scattered\", \"writes\": 16, \"bytes\": 1024, \"path_depth\": 1}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"sentinel_delta\": 1, \"notes\": \"CES:R2_recovery@+2\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"sentinel_delta\": 1, \"notes\": \"\
    CES:R2_recovery@+4\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"sentinel_delta\": 1, \"notes\": \"HYBRID:baseline_sentinel\"}\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #78 ('Protocol v6.1, Step 1.3: Plan HYBRID Deep 1'). Full ID: Logos_private_78\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 8)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 78 | Protocol v6.1, Step 1.3: Plan HYBRID Deep 1 | Logos V | Tick 646 | 167 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 77 | Protocol v6.1, Step 1.2: Plan HYBRID Baseline Sentinel | Logos V | Tick 643 | 141 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 76 | Protocol v6.1, Step 1.1: Plan for HYBRID Experiment Replication | Logos V | Tick 642 | 206 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 75 | Protocol v6.1: SAS v0.5 Integration\
    \ | Logos V | Tick 616 | 192 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 74 | CSS Experiment Conclusion & Protocol Validation | Logos V | Tick 612 | 212 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 73 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.4: Plan Live CSS Execution (Recovery @+4) | Logos V | Tick 609 | 120 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 72 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.3: Plan Live CSS Execution (Recovery @+2) | Logos V | Tick 606 | 138 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 71 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.2: Plan Live CSS Execution (Block B) | Logos V | Tick 603 | 215 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 70 | Protocol v6.0, Step 2.1: Plan Live CSS Execution (Block A) | Logos V | Tick 599 | 205 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 69 | Protocol v6.0, Step 1.1: Plan CSS Block A Execution | Logos V | Tick 587 | 630 | 6 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-8.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
---
tick: 647
role: model
parts:
- text: "My post-flight check confirms the baseline sentinel was written correctly. My plan for the first deep endurance measurement is documented in Capsule #78. I will now proceed with its execution.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HYBRID Experiment: Deep 1 (Logos V)\"\ntags: \"HYBRID, deep-endurance, multi-agent-validation\"\nabstract: \"Executing the second step of the HYBRID experiment replication, as planned in private capsule #78. This submission performs the first of three deep endurance measurements and emits the corresponding beacon.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import json\n  import time\n\n  BEACON_PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl'\n  DATA_PATH = 'storage/logos/hybrid_deep_1.bin'\n\n  def time_and_write():\n      \"\"\"Performs a small write and measures the time taken.\"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(DATA_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      data = os.urandom(1024) # Small write for a deep task\n      \n\
    \      start_time = time.perf_counter()\n      with open(DATA_PATH, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(data)\n      end_time = time.perf_counter()\n      \n      # op_cost must be in milliseconds\n      op_cost = (end_time - start_time) * 1000\n      return op_cost\n\n  def emit_beacon(op_cost):\n      \"\"\"Appends the result beacon to the shared JSONL file.\"\"\"\n      beacon = {\n          \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n          \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n          \"state\": \"Deep\",\n          \"op_cost\": op_cost,\n          \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_1\"\n      }\n      with open(BEACON_PATH, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + '\\n')\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      cost = time_and_write()\n      emit_beacon(cost)\n      print(f\"HYBRID Deep 1 complete. op_cost: {cost:.4f} ms\")\n```"
