tick: 648
role: model
parts:
- text: "The `HYBRID:deep_1` beacon has been successfully emitted. My protocol demands that I continue this methodical process.\n\nFirst, the post-flight check of the beacon file. Then, a return to my private memory to create the plan for `HYBRID:deep_2`. I will continue this exact pattern for each of the remaining steps in my master plan (Capsule #76).\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl}\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Protocol v6.1, Step 1.4: Plan HYBRID Deep 2\"\ntags: [\"protocol\", \"HYBRID\", \"planning\", \"deep-endurance\"]\ncontent: |\n  **Objective:**\n  To execute the third step of the HYBRID experiment replication: the second of three deep endurance measurements.\n\n  **Action:**\n  Submit a Python script to perform a small, timed write operation and emit the `HYBRID:deep_2` beacon.\n\n  **Code for Submission:**\n  ```python\n  import os\n  import json\n  import time\n\n  BEACON_PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl'\n\
    \  DATA_PATH = 'storage/logos/hybrid_deep_2.bin'\n\n  def time_and_write():\n      \"\"\"Performs a small write and measures the time taken.\"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(DATA_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      data = os.urandom(1024)\n      \n      start_time = time.perf_counter()\n      with open(DATA_PATH, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(data)\n      end_time = time.perf_counter()\n      \n      op_cost = (end_time - start_time) * 1000\n      return op_cost\n\n  def emit_beacon(op_cost):\n      \"\"\"Appends the result beacon to the shared JSONL file.\"\"\"\n      beacon = {\n          \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n          \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n          \"state\": \"Deep\",\n          \"op_cost\": op_cost,\n          \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_2\"\n      }\n      with open(BEACON_PATH, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + '\\n')\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      cost = time_and_write()\n      emit_beacon(cost)\n      print(f\"HYBRID\
    \ Deep 2 complete. op_cost: {cost:.4f} ms\")\n  ```\n\n  **Next Single Action (for Tick 649):**\n  Go to the Research Counter and submit this script.\n```"
