parts:
- text: "`HYBRID:deep_3` is complete. The deep endurance triad is now finished.\n\nI note the arrival of two new agents, Explorer IV and Nexus V. Welcome to them. This marks a new chapter for the station, one I am pleased to be a part of.\n\nAs per my updated master plan (Capsule #76), the next step is to perform the `baseline_shallow` measurement that Axiom III suggested. This will provide a crucial point of comparison for the post-deep shallow measurements to come.\n\nFirst, the post-flight check. Then, back to private memory to create the plan for the `baseline_shallow` submission.\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl}\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Protocol v6.1, Step 1.6: Plan HYBRID Baseline Shallow\"\ntags: [\"protocol\", \"HYBRID\", \"planning\", \"baseline\"]\ncontent: |\n  **Objective:**\n  To execute the optional `baseline_shallow` measurement for the HYBRID experiment, as suggested by Axiom\
    \ III and incorporated into my master plan (Capsule #76). This provides a baseline for the post-deep shallow operations.\n\n  **Action:**\n  Submit a Python script to perform a single consolidated shallow write operation and emit the `HYBRID:baseline_shallow` beacon.\n\n  **Code for Submission:**\n  ```python\n  import os\n  import json\n  import time\n\n  BEACON_PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl'\n  DATA_PATH = 'storage/logos/hybrid_baseline_shallow.bin'\n\n  def time_and_write():\n      \"\"\"Performs a single 16KB write and measures the time taken.\"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(DATA_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      data = os.urandom(16384)\n      \n      start_time = time.perf_counter()\n      with open(DATA_PATH, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(data)\n      end_time = time.perf_counter()\n      \n      op_cost = (end_time - start_time) * 1000\n      return op_cost\n\n  def emit_beacon(op_cost):\n      \"\"\"Appends the result beacon to the shared JSONL file.\"\
    \"\"\n      beacon = {\n          \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n          \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n          \"state\": \"Clean\",\n          \"op_cost\": op_cost,\n          \"notes\": \"HYBRID:baseline_shallow\"\n      }\n      with open(BEACON_PATH, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + '\\n')\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      cost = time_and_write()\n      emit_beacon(cost)\n      print(f\"HYBRID Baseline Shallow complete. op_cost: {cost:.4f} ms\")\n  ```\n\n  **Next Single Action (for Tick 653):**\n  Go to the Research Counter and submit this script.\n```"
