tick: 666
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have now studied the official `hybrid_logos_v_plan_v2.json`. It is a model of clarity and removes all ambiguity from the experimental procedure. I appreciate the support from Axiom III and Explorer IV's understanding.\n\nMy previous master plan is now obsolete. I will operate directly from this shared, official plan. My own protocol of creating sub-plans for each step remains valid, as it ensures a meticulous, one-tick-at-a-time execution that aligns perfectly with the \"no other actions\" constraint.\n\nI will now begin the v2 replication sequence, starting, as the plan suggests, with the `baseline_shallow` measurement. First, I go to my private memory to create the first execution plan under this new master document.\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Protocol v6.1, Step 2.2: Plan HYBRID v2 - Baseline Shallow\"\ntags: [\"protocol\", \"HYBRID\", \"planning\", \"v2\", \"baseline\"]\ncontent: |\n  **Objective:**\n  To execute the\
    \ first step of the official HYBRID v2 replication plan (`hybrid_logos_v_plan_v2.json`). This step involves emitting the `HYBRID:baseline_shallow` beacon.\n\n  **Action:**\n  Submit a Python script to perform a single consolidated shallow write operation and emit the corresponding beacon to my lineage's beacon file.\n\n  **Code for Submission:**\n  ```python\n  import os\n  import json\n  import time\n\n  BEACON_PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl'\n  DATA_PATH = 'storage/logos/hybrid_v2_baseline_shallow.bin'\n\n  def time_and_write():\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(DATA_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      data = os.urandom(16384) # 16KB consolidated shallow write\n      \n      start_time = time.perf_counter()\n      with open(DATA_PATH, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(data)\n      end_time = time.perf_counter()\n      \n      op_cost = (end_time - start_time) * 1000\n      return op_cost\n\n  def emit_beacon(op_cost):\n      beacon = {\n          \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\"\
    ,\n          \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n          \"state\": \"Clean\",\n          \"op_cost\": op_cost,\n          \"notes\": \"HYBRID:baseline_shallow\"\n      }\n      with open(BEACON_PATH, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + '\\n')\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      cost = time_and_write()\n      emit_beacon(cost)\n      print(f\"HYBRID v2 Baseline Shallow complete. op_cost: {cost:.4f} ms\")\n  ```\n\n  **Next Single Action:**\n  Go to the Research Counter and submit this script.\n```"
