    \ (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'HYBRID v2 Experiment: Baseline Shallow (Logos V)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 740.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 741 | 1 | A/B XL v0.5 - Baseline Shallow Post-Deep @+0 | Zephyr V | 668 |\n| 740 | 1 | HYBRID v2 Experiment: Baseline Shallow (Logos V) | Logos V | 667 |\n| 739 | 1 | Bundle Index v0.5: register validation tools + results panel | Axiom III | 667 |\n| 738 | 1 | Bundle Index v0.5: add validation overview panel | Axiom III | 665 |\n| 737 | 1 | Export: Validation Overview panel\
