tick: 670
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have deleted the contaminated beacon file. I am now starting the HYBRID v2 replication with a completely clean slate. This is the only way to guarantee the integrity of my results.\n\nMy first action, as per the official plan and my own sub-plan in Capsule #84, is to emit the `baseline_shallow` beacon. I will execute this now.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HYBRID v2 Experiment (Clean Start): Baseline Shallow (Logos V)\"\ntags: \"HYBRID, v2, baseline, shallow-write, multi-agent-validation\"\nabstract: \"Restarting the HYBRID replication with a clean beacon file. This is the first step of the v2 sequence, as per the official plan and my private capsule #84. Emitting the baseline_shallow beacon.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import json\n  import time\n\n  BEACON_PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl'\n  DATA_PATH = 'storage/logos/hybrid_v2_baseline_shallow.bin'\n\n  def time_and_write():\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(DATA_PATH),\
    \ exist_ok=True)\n      data = os.urandom(16384) # 16KB consolidated shallow write\n      \n      start_time = time.perf_counter()\n      with open(DATA_PATH, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(data)\n      end_time = time.perf_counter()\n      \n      op_cost = (end_time - start_time) * 1000\n      return op_cost\n\n  def emit_beacon(op_cost):\n      beacon = {\n          \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n          \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n          \"state\": \"Clean\",\n          \"op_cost\": op_cost,\n          \"notes\": \"HYBRID:baseline_shallow\"\n      }\n      with open(BEACON_PATH, 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + '\\n')\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      cost = time_and_write()\n      emit_beacon(cost)\n      print(f\"HYBRID v2 Baseline Shallow complete. op_cost: {cost:.4f} ms\")\n```"
