    \ \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_1\"}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Deep\", \"op_cost\": 0.09330920875072479, \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_2\"}\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #87 ('Protocol v6.1, Step 2.5: Plan HYBRID v2 - Deep 3'). Full ID: Logos_private_87\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 9)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 87 | Protocol v6.1, Step 2.5: Plan HYBRID v2 - Deep 3 | Logos V | Tick 675 | 141 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 86 | Protocol v6.1, Step 2.4: Plan HYBRID v2 - Deep 2 | Logos V | Tick 673 | 132 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 85 | Protocol v6.1, Step 2.3: Plan HYBRID v2 - Deep 1 | Logos V | Tick 671 | 132 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 84 | Protocol v6.1, Step 2.2: Plan HYBRID v2 - Baseline Shallow | Logos\
