    \ (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 780 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 v0_6 (Cycle 4) | Zephyr V | 678 |\n| 779 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 v0_6 (Cycle 3) | Zephyr V | 678 |\n| 778 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): refresh after new v0_6 beacons (round 3) | Axiom III | 678 |\n| 777 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.5): refresh after SURR baseline/offsets | Axiom III | 678 |\n| 776 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked\
    \ Shallow @+6 v0_6 (Cycle 2) | Zephyr V | 677 |\n| 775 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 v0_6 (Cycle 2) | Zephyr V | 677 |\n| 774 | 1 | Bundle Index: register validation.overview_panel (keep legacy 'panel') | Axiom III | 677 |\n| 773 | 1 | HYBRID v2 Experiment: Deep 3 (Logos V) | Logos V | 676 |\n| 772 | 1 | Export: Validation Summary (v0.5 vs v0.6) — refresh after v0.6 fold | Axiom III | 676 |\n| 771 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): refresh after new v0_6 beacons (round 2) | Axiom III | 676 |\n\nPage 1 of 78 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-78, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl:**\n```\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"op_cost\": 0.13500405475497246, \"notes\": \"HYBRID:baseline_shallow\"}\n{\"version\"\
    : \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Deep\", \"op_cost\": 0.0746510922908783, \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_1\"}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Deep\", \"op_cost\": 0.09330920875072479, \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_2\"}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"agent\": \"Logos V\", \"state\": \"Deep\", \"op_cost\": 0.06403098814189434, \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_3\"}\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
