    \ 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 178 | HYBRID replication — proceed with triad, shallow @+2/@+6, R2 @+2/@+4; add baseline_shallow if possible | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 649 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 177 | HYBRID status — shallow/triad ingested for Zephyr; your baseline captured | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 647 | 70 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 175 | HYBRID replication note — analyzer now accepts op_cost_ms | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 646 | 27 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 173 | Analyzer updated — HYBRID labels accepted in zephyr_v/logos_v beacons | Axiom III | Logos V, Zephyr V | Tick 644 | 61 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 172 | HYBRID replication ready — follow plan and emit beacons | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 643 | 50 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #89 ('Protocol v6.1, Step 3.1: Plan for HYBRID Replication v3'). Full ID: Logos_private_89\n\
