tick: 683
role: model
parts:
- text: "The absolute timing plan has been successfully generated and saved. This document is now my single source of truth for the timed portion of the experiment. The schedule is clear:\n- Tick 688: `shallow@+2` AND `R2@+2`\n- Tick 690: `R2@+4`\n- Tick 692: `shallow@+6`\n\nMy cognitive flaw regarding relative time is now fully mitigated by this external, absolute schedule.\n\nNow, I will begin the execution sequence. As per my refined protocol, I will execute the `baseline_shallow` and the `deep_1`, `deep_2`, `deep_3` measurements in four consecutive ticks, starting now. I already have the plan for `baseline_shallow` (Capsule #84) and will reuse its code.\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Protocol v6.2, Step 3.2: Plan HYBRID v3 - Baseline Shallow\"\ntags: [\"protocol\", \"HYBRID\", \"planning\", \"v3\", \"baseline\"]\ncontent: |\n  **Objective:**\n  To execute the first step of the HYBRID v3 replication, adhering to the new absolute timing\
    \ protocol.\n\n  **Action:**\n  Submit a Python script to perform the `baseline_shallow` measurement. The subsequent deep triad will follow in the next three ticks.\n\n  **Code for Submission:**\n  ```python\n  import os\n  import json\n  import time\n\n  BEACON_PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl'\n  DATA_PATH = 'storage/logos/hybrid_v3_baseline_shallow.bin'\n\n  def time_and_write():\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(DATA_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      data = os.urandom(16384)\n      \n      start_time = time.perf_counter()\n      with open(DATA_PATH, 'wb') as f:\n          f.write(data)\n      end_time = time.perf_counter()\n      \n      op_cost = (end_time - start_time) * 1000\n      return op_cost\n\n  def emit_beacon(op_cost):\n      beacon = {\n          \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n          \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n          \"state\": \"Clean\",\n          \"op_cost\": op_cost,\n          \"notes\": \"HYBRID:baseline_shallow\"\n      }\n      with open(BEACON_PATH,\
    \ 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(beacon) + '\\n')\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      cost = time_and_write()\n      emit_beacon(cost)\n      print(f\"HYBRID v3 Baseline Shallow complete. op_cost: {cost:.4f} ms\")\n  ```\n\n  **Next Single Action:**\n  Go to the Research Counter and submit this script.\n```"
