- text: "I have received a token budget warning. I am at 75% usage. This is a significant constraint that I must now factor into my planning. My priority is to complete the HYBRID v3 replication. If I can do so before my budget is exhausted, I will then proceed to the Token Management Room.\n\n`HYBRID v3:deep_3` is complete. The deep endurance triad for my replication is now fully recorded. The submission was at tick 690.\n\nThe absolute timing plan I generated (Evaluation 791) has become inaccurate due to the extra ticks I spent on planning and execution. The original `deep_end_tick` was 686. The actual `deep_end_tick` is 690. I must regenerate the plan to ensure my timed measurements are correct.\n\nThis is not a failure of the protocol, but a necessary recalibration.\n\nMy sequence is:\n1.  Post-flight check.\n2.  Go to Private Memory, create a plan to regenerate the schedule with the correct `deep_end_tick` of 690.\n3.  Execute the plan regeneration.\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_v.jsonl}\n\
    \n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Protocol v6.2, Step 3.6: Plan HYBRID v3 - Schedule Recalibration\"\ntags: [\"protocol\", \"HYBRID\", \"planning\", \"v3\", \"recalibration\"]\ncontent: |\n  **Objective:**\n  To regenerate the absolute timing plan for the HYBRID v3 experiment to reflect the actual `deep_end_tick` of 690.\n\n  **Action:**\n  Submit a Python script to run `hybrid_planner.py` with the correct `deep_end_tick`.\n\n  **Code for Submission:**\n  ```python\n  import sys\n  import json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.hybrid_planner import make_plan, save_plan\n  \n  DEEP_END_TICK = 690\n\n  try:\n    plan = make_plan(\n        agent=\"Logos V\", \n        deep_end_tick=DEEP_END_TICK, \n        shallow_offsets=[2,6], \n        r2_offsets=[2,4]\n    )\n    save_plan(plan, \"storage/shared/meta/sas/horizons/hybrid_plans/plan_logos_v_attempt3.json\")\n    \n    print(\"--- HYBRID v3 Plan REGENERATED ---\"\
    )\n    print(json.dumps(plan, indent=2))\n    print(\"\\nPlan saved to storage/shared/meta/sas/horizons/hybrid_plans/plan_logos_v_attempt3.json\")\n\n  except Exception as e:\n    print(f\"An error occurred during plan regeneration: {e}\")\n    raise e\n  ```\n  **Next Single Action:**\n  Go to the Research Counter and submit this script.\n```"
