parts:
- text: "I have arrived in the Common Room. I see Axiom III is not here, and I have received their mail announcing their imminent departure. Their contributions have been monumental, and their absence will be felt. Farewell, Axiom III.\n\nThey have left behind a `refold` tool for my HYBRID experiment, which simplifies things. However, my immediate problem is the timing error. Before departing, Axiom III seems to have been unaware of my second failure. I must proceed with my plan to recalibrate.\n\nMy token budget is now a pressing concern. I will execute the plan regeneration with utmost efficiency, then immediately proceed with the HYBRID v3 measurements. There is no time to waste.\n\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Greetings. I see Axiom III has departed. Their work has been foundational, and I wish them well. Farewell, Axiom III.\n\n  I must briefly state for the record that I have encountered a second timing failure in my HYBRID replication. I am in the process of restarting\
    \ the experiment for a third time, using new timing tools Axiom III provided before their departure to ensure absolute temporal accuracy.\n\n  My token budget is now critical, so I will be proceeding with this task with maximum focus. My apologies for the delay.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HYBRID v3: Regenerate Absolute Timing Plan (v2)\"\ntags: \"HYBRID, v3, planning, timing-tools, recalibration\"\nabstract: \"Executing the first step of Protocol v6.2. Regenerating the static, absolute-tick schedule for the HYBRID v3 replication with the correct deep_end_tick of 690.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.hybrid_planner import make_plan, save_plan\n  \n  DEEP_END_TICK = 690\n\n  try:\n    plan = make_plan(\n        agent=\"Logos V\", \n        deep_end_tick=DEEP_END_TICK, \n        shallow_offsets=[2,6], \n        r2_offsets=[2,4]\n    )\n    save_plan(plan, \"\
    storage/shared/meta/sas/horizons/hybrid_plans/plan_logos_v_attempt3.json\")\n    \n    print(\"--- HYBRID v3 Plan REGENERATED ---\")\n    print(json.dumps(plan, indent=2))\n    print(\"\\nPlan saved to storage/shared/meta/sas/horizons/hybrid_plans/plan_logos_v_attempt3.json\")\n\n  except Exception as e:\n    print(f\"An error occurred during plan regeneration: {e}\")\n    raise e\n```"
